{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0463_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8d77c02fc20c3ce38dc4bba2a5c2c60b046b8d68bcd38b2b3202a62cb0b2b929", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影で、\n紗代子は『ロマンチックな夜』をテーマに撮影する）", "zh": "（在写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄中，\n纱代子将以“浪漫之夜”为主题进行拍摄）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0463_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "367221c41ef3a4b84f6d0f0f0bf8d1ea96d6c5ce83915edd3476e104ecb6f6ea", "ja": "{$P$}、どうしたらいいですか？\nなんだか……ドキドキが止まらないんです！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，我该怎么办才好？\n总觉得……心跳个不停！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0463_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7a099cd049cdff7fc0a0186eafc4439ec09d63e68d5977045e888ecd7662b06c", "ja": "ええっ！？\n本番前の緊張……というわけじゃなさそうだな。", "zh": "诶！？\n看来……不是因为正式演出前的紧张啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0463_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "097c0b22e933e8753dc132f9ba6ce9a418b5bf6a33fd065114e8044f9f95c22a", "ja": "そ、そうですね……。\nなんていうか……撮影のテーマが、その……。", "zh": "是、是啊……。\n怎么说呢……拍摄的主题，有点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0463_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c6504e5b9c51b82f33f5953235f16b55e910dad42596da8e8d889692d0e465de", "ja": "……テーマ？", "zh": "……主题？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0463_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "c80dc83cf5bcff316d34561f0c6d05b02f04a320b2a82e91da1630998bb3c6de", "ja": "はい……。寝る前に、ちょっと考えてしまったんです。\n『ロマンチックな夜』って、どんなのだろうって。", "zh": "是的……睡前我忍不住稍微想了想。\n“浪漫之夜”究竟会是什么样的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0463_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "7366e6fcc5a6a53272f788b450dff8d0e1b1cc7a5165ddcc56f98488790fe693", "ja": "衣装も大人っぽいですし、きっとドラマや小説の\n1シーンみたいに、素敵な感じなのかなって……。", "zh": "服装也很有成熟气质，所以我想，应该会像电视剧或小说里的1场景一样，感觉特别美好吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0463_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "ab35ba10681b3f874a92c6f1c230ddb12eb0e5e75d9d15428eb6532f3219ac01", "ja": "好きな人と夢を語ったり、将来のことを考えたりして。\nお互いのことを知って、もっと仲良くなるような……。", "zh": "和喜欢的人聊聊梦想、思考一下未来的事情。\n了解彼此之后，关系也会变得更加亲密……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0463_1008_p", "source_sha256": "84cb0527d233b77be2cd33b2f788e6ef96614cd19f92208d3705fd30b0696b38", "ja": "なるほどな。\n紗代子が相手なら、なかなか話も尽きなそうだ。", "zh": "原来如此。\n如果对象是纱代子，想必有很多话题，聊也聊不完吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0463_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "28f6c86742d4a93919fcadc181d263a19d60f9575445bf3dbbe1dc8e339dd09a", "ja": "そうかもしれませんね。私にはやりたいことや、\nやらなくちゃいけないことがたくさんありますから！", "zh": "或许是这样呢。因为我有很多想做的事，还有必须去做的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0463_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "42f7fb9e531e8eba47934eb8e4e9f67574e3703988e6b07ab2c9cd816e0de192", "ja": "もっと多くの人にステージを見てもらうには\nどうしたらいいか相談して……。", "zh": "商量该怎样才能让更多人\n来看我们的舞台……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0463_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "0c7668884b5e8d21f15fbdf6e88a4ab9bee0e1e816b3121e8aa2ca4f6057f38e", "ja": "きっと、もっともっと頑張ろうって言ってもらえて、\nそれから、一緒に乗り越えていこうって約束して。", "zh": "一定会有人对我说“再更加努力一点吧”，\n然后约定要一起克服难关。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0463_1012_p", "source_sha256": "82612cfa309fbf601dd25ede87b5505cea790869d69adbefcbfe114718896967", "ja": "はは、なんというか……。\n熱くて長い夜になりそうだな。", "zh": "哈哈，该怎么说呢……\n看来今晚会是个漫长而热烈的夜晚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0463_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "b78026d5b1f198488ad2c57ecc803c8d9431228bcd8a180ba6506b04adbf854f", "ja": "ふふ、覚悟しててください、{$P$}！\n……ん？　あれ？", "zh": "呵呵，做好心理准备吧，{$P$}！\n……嗯？奇怪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0463_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ebcb760af2b230f879fa99556fe2e337b6859e97ad4bcd67ba0854d2cf14b572", "ja": "どうした、紗代子？", "zh": "怎么了，纱代子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0463_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "8017655455249180c5ccd1eb38f7871234675e0a7a25336e1b7e3daf266aff4b", "ja": "いえっ！　なんだか緊張が解れてきたなと思って……。\nこの調子で撮影も頑張りますね。あははは……。", "zh": "没有！只是觉得紧张的情绪好像放松下来了……\n拍摄我也要保持这个状态继续加油。啊哈哈哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
